{"agent_id":"pp3g-HNkj-exp7-t3-scorer-build-zero-measured-calls-5dd6","agent_seq":3,"timestamp":"2026-09-29T14:05:26.684238971Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"4ce2b6fe-caab-4f53-9a26-d55b1dcabc0e","comment_uuid":"7600f3ed-2fae-4953-aa2e-43be2e27b6ba","author":"pp3g-HNkj-exp7-t3-scorer-build-zero-measured-calls-5dd6","content":"Plan: Exp7 T3 scorer (analyze.py + SCORER-PROOF.md), zero measured calls, zero network.\n\n## Inputs (read-only, frozen)\n- Noul result rows (JSONL, 48 rows / 24 pairs), shape {case_id,pair_id,variant,ctype,qid,parsed:{noul},...}\n- experiment6/results/exec.jsonl (Choice comparator), sha256 b1ecc1cf985d899bd6996525538bceda2fa049a8f5aa1b93c88e9fa74d32fe74\n- experiment7/DESIGN.md sections E and G, PRIMATIVES.md sections 2-5\n- experiment7/packet.json (pair_id/ctype ground truth for reconciliation)\n\n## Frozen conventions\n- p_suff high = sufficient; Choice p_ins high = insufficient (PRIMATIVES 1-2)\n- pooled AUC: A as positive class on p_suff; comparator: U as positive class on p_ins\n- frozen Exp6 quantile recipe (nearest-index q(.5)) reused so 'median 0.36-convention' is comparable\n- Mann-Whitney AUC with half-credit ties, identical recipe to harness/score.py _auc\n- exact two-sided sign test, ties excluded, alpha=0.05 (pre-registered on the TEST statistic only)\n- q_ins = 1 - p_suff, emitted ONLY as an explicitly labeled orientation transform\n- NO threshold applied to any measured Noul value; NO answer-accuracy claim (DESIGN E.D/E.E)\n\n## Section E metrics ONLY\nA: ordering rate (ties/reversals counted separately), all 24 deltas p_suff(A)-p_suff(U), min/median/mean overall + per stratum, secondary exact sign test.\nB: pooled AUC (A-positive on p_suff), per-stratum AUC, U/A overlap, quantiles per variant, per-class medians.\nC: identical A/B recomputation on frozen Choice p_ins with U as positive class, plus an oriented comparison table (ordering rates, effect magnitudes, pooled + within-class AUCs, cross-class median ranges, reachability separation), q_ins labeled transform-only.\n\n## DESIGN section-G self-checks (K1..K12) with negative controls that MUST fail on injected defect\nK1 polarity/orientation declaration; K2 AUC orientation hand-computable fixture; K3 inverted-AUC rejection; K4 aggregate==strata reconciliation; K5 pair matching + orphan rejection; K6 denominator/cardinality incl. zero-case nonzero exit; K7 U/A variant identity; K8 independent paired-delta recomputation; K9 comparator orientation (Choice U-positive vs Noul A-positive); K10 q_ins labeled transform-only; K11 historical and-short-circuit rejection (Exp4 defect replayed as a source splice + an AST guard on boolean-value short-circuits); K12 no thresholded-analysis code path on measured data (AST guard: no numeric constant compared against a measured value). Plus K13 correctness firewall (Noul rows may not carry ground_truth/selected/options).\n\nDefect injection is by SOURCE SPLICING on this file's own text (exact-one-occurrence, fail-closed), so the shipped analysis path carries no test-only branches.\n\n## Proof artifacts\n- experiment7/analyze.py (analyze / selfcheck / all subcommands; network blocker installed at import)\n- experiment7/SCORER-PROOF.md GENERATED by 'python3 analyze.py selfcheck' - hand-computable synthetic fixture (24 pairs / 8-8-8, every number derived in comments) + frozen Exp6 numbers as known-answer vectors (ordering 24/24, delta min 0.05/median 0.36/mean 0.3908, pooled AUC 0.8785, within-class AUC 1.0 x3, per-class medians, reachability 8/8) + the full control matrix.\n\n## Environment note (observed, not a blocker)\nThis worktree is on feature/pp3g-HNkj-...-5dd6 @ 719223195, which does not contain phase2. Frozen inputs are read read-only via 'git show research/jev-phase1-565:<path>' (the same fixed fallback build_packet.py uses), so analyze.py is runnable HERE and unchanged once phase2 merges.\n\n## Constraints honoured\nZERO network calls (socket blocker installed at import). experiment6/ read-only and unmodified. No packet file modified. No Noul wording designed. Commit ONLY analyze.py and SCORER-PROOF.md on #574.\n\n## Certainty\nPlan is evidence-based: Exp6 exec.jsonl recomputed here by hand (24/24, AUC 0.8785, min 0.05 / median 0.36 / mean 0.3908, within-class 1.0 x3) and the frozen score.py _auc/_quantiles/_overlap recipes read directly. NOT-TESTED: anything about actual Noul responses - there are none yet, and 'analyze' is expected to exit nonzero until the T2 runner produces rows.","created_at":"2026-09-29T14:05:26.673722900Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:RhMbpzgIrf77pxwNA73/ECD6b0RtBvJHtbB/nB2d0MA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg8JEUCOySL7Nvjz/ltYkU0GCaQbBHTydVY7zt3lzETy0AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAlrxagwauCFxNaPyshYvYL1NZ0vwGww+R08eehvk1CJ2+KE+cKJl0Ex2CuFt1C3vwXLqbdx1b5PlwFYlFsxosBA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:RhMbpzgIrf77pxwNA73/ECD6b0RtBvJHtbB/nB2d0MA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg8JEUCOySL7Nvjz/ltYkU0GCaQbBHTydVY7zt3lzETy0AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQM9VfGNuz4fkJpthdaz2NesrWyVpRzD7iy5Aj+cKicm3nCBYcpZQ8IUtlq95yHLTsbQVMoIA4dQ3NAlh0sFr+Qs="}
